    "name": "Festival National du Film de Tanger",
    "id": "festival-national-film-tanger",
    "description": "Morocco's national film festival, created in 1982 and organized by the Centre Cinématographique Marocain (CCM) to showcase Moroccan feature films, documentaries and short films in competition. First held in Rabat, the festival has been hosted in Tangier since its 8th edition (2005) and has run there continuously and annually since its 11th edition (2010).",
